{{!
    @template local_mail/view

    Mount point of the mailbox app and the data it starts from.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    The app (svelte/src/view.ts) mounts on the element with id local-mail-view and reads
    window.local_mail_view_data.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * data: The initial data, JSON-encoded by view.php with the JSON_HEX_* flags, so that no
      value can close the script element.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "data": "{\"userid\": 2, \"mobile\": false}"
    }
}}
<div id="local-mail-view"></div>
<script>window.local_mail_view_data = {{{data}}};</script>
